onnectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [91, 168], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "LATENT", "links": [97], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [410, 510], "pos": [-194.13400268554688, 213.73097229003906], "widgets_values": ["integrated_multimodal_description:\n\n[Shot 1]\n\nLive-action, cinematic ancient Chinese suspense style, presented in a 16:9 widescreen composition.\n\nA medium-wide shot establishes a crowded wooden inn at night.\n\nWarm lanterns illuminate drifting steam, wooden tables, traveling merchants, and rain-streaked lattice windows.\n\nA young female swordswoman with long black hair tied in a high ponytail sits alone at a corner table.\n\nShe wears a dark-green fitted robe, black leather bracers, and a sheathed sword at her waist.\n\nA silent waiter places a ceramic wine cup in front of her.\n\nThe camera slowly pushes in as she studies the wine without drinking.\n\n\n[Shot 2]\n\nAt 00:02.000, the camera cuts to an extreme close-up of the wine cup.\n\nThe female swordswoman removes a silver hairpin and lowers its tip into the clear wine.\n\nAs she lifts the hairpin, the immersed silver tip rapidly turns black.\n\nHer fingers stop moving.\n\nThe surrounding inn ambience becomes muffled while a single drop of wine falls back into the cup.\n\n\n[Shot 3]\n\nAt 00:03.800, the shot cuts to a tight side view.\n\nThe female swordswoman sharply knocks the poisoned wine cup away with the back of her hand.\n\nAt the same instant, a crossbow bolt flies from off-screen and strikes the airborne cup.\n\nThe ceramic cup shatters in front of the camera, scattering wine and fragments across the table.\n\nShe ducks beneath the bolt while the camera shakes strongly with the impact.\n\n\n[Shot 4]\n\nAt 00:05.600, the camera cuts to a low-angle shot of the inn's second-floor balcony.\n\nA masked assassin wearing a black hood and dark cloth armor lowers a compact crossbow.\n\nThe assassin turns and vaults over the balcony railing toward an open window.\n\nThe camera pans right with large amplitude at fast speed as the black figure disappears into the rain outside.\n\n\n[Shot 5]\n\nAt 00:07.800, the shot cuts back to the female swordswoman.\n\nShe rises from the table, draws her sword in one fluid motion, and runs toward the open window.\n\nThe camera tracks beside her at fast speed as frightened guests move out of her path.\n\nShe leaps through the window into the rain-covered alley.\n\nThe camera rapidly pulls out, revealing the swordswoman pursuing the masked assassin across the tiled rooftops.\n\nA flash of lightning freezes both figures in silhouette at 00:10.000.\n\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nLow inn conversation, clinking bowls, crackling firewood, and steady rain establish the opening environment.\n\nThe silver hairpin touches the cup with a faint metallic ring, followed by rushing fabric, a crossbow snap, shattering ceramic, frightened gasps, a sword leaving its scabbard, rapid footsteps, wind, and a final thunderclap.\n\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nSparse guqin notes and a low sustained bowed-string drone begin at a slow tempo.\n\nRapid wooden percussion enters when the crossbow bolt strikes the cup, building into fast war-drum beats before ending sharply with the lightning flash.", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 83, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 84, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name":